# Vue Component Rules

::callout{type="info"}
Guidelines for Vue 3 components using Options API and shadcn-vue
::

## Vue 3 Options API

::callout{type="warning"}
ALWAYS use Vue 3 Options API (not Composition API)
::

### Component Structure
- **Template-first**: `<template>` at the top, then `<script>`
- **Options API syntax**: `data()`, `computed`, `methods`, `mounted()`, etc.
- **Auto-imports**: Rely on Nuxt's auto-import for components and composables

::code-group

```vue [Standard Component]
<template>
  <div v-if="isLoading">
    <Skeleton class="h-4 w-20" />
  </div>
  <div v-else-if="data">
    <!-- Content -->
  </div>
  <div v-else>
    <!-- Error state -->
  </div>
</template>

<script>
export default {
  name: 'ComponentName',
  data() {
    return {
      isLoading: false,
      data: null,
      error: null
    }
  },
  computed: {
    // computed properties
  },
  methods: {
    // methods
  },
  async mounted() {
    // lifecycle hooks
  }
}
</script>
```

```vue [With Authentication]
<template>
  <div v-if="user">
    <h1>Welcome, {{ user.name }}!</h1>
    <Button @click="handleLogout">Sign Out</Button>
  </div>
  <div v-else>
    <NuxtLink to="/auth">Sign In</NuxtLink>
  </div>
</template>

<script>
import { authClient } from '~/lib/auth-client'

export default {
  name: 'UserComponent',
  data() {
    return {
      session: null,
      isLoading: true
    }
  },
  computed: {
    user() {
      return this.session?.user || null
    }
  },
  methods: {
    async handleLogout() {
      await authClient.signOut()
      await navigateTo('/auth')
    }
  },
  async mounted() {
    const { data: session, isPending } = await authClient.useSession(useFetch)
    this.session = session.value
    this.isLoading = isPending.value
  }
}
</script>
```

::

## Component Imports

::callout{type="note"}
Leverage Nuxt's auto-imports for cleaner code
::

### Auto-Imported Components
- **NO manual imports** for UI components
- **shadcn-vue components**: Button, Input, Skeleton, etc.
- **Only import when necessary**: auth clients, external libraries

```vue
<template>
  <!-- ✅ Auto-imported shadcn-vue components -->
  <Button variant="primary">Click me</Button>
  <Input v-model="inputValue" />
  <Skeleton class="h-4 w-20" />
  
  <!-- ✅ Auto-imported Nuxt components -->
  <NuxtLink to="/dashboard">Dashboard</NuxtLink>
  <Icon name="lucide:user" />
</template>

<script>
// ✅ Only import external libraries
import { authClient } from '~/lib/auth-client'

export default {
  // Component logic
}
</script>
```

